  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0165" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00503/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#hand_black_driver">
              <opener>
                <seg hand="#print_seh">
                  <lb/>TELEPHONE: <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_46">OXFORD</rs> 45511
                 </seg> 
                <seg hand="#print_seh">
                  <lb/><orgName><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_354">ST. EDMUND HALL</rs></orgName>,
                  <lb/><placeName><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_46">OXFORD</rs></placeName>,
                  <lb/>OX1 4AR.
                </seg>  
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/>19<hi rend="superscript"><unclear>th.</unclear></hi> July 1973
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Mr. Auden</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/>I am writing well in advance to ask if you will be able
                <lb/>to present a record evening for the <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_354">S.E.H.</rs> Music Club sometime next term.
                <lb/>You may perhaps recall that I 'interviewed' you (for <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_355">'Cherwell'</rs>) at St.Aldates
                <lb/>Coffee House in Hilary Term<unclear>;</unclear> and there inveigled you. You gave tacit assent.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>Meetings constitute simply the presentation by members
                <lb/>of their own choice of records - over a glass of sherry. Our plan has been to
                <lb/>have at least one guest evening each term. Should you be willing<unclear>,</unclear> you 
                <lb/>might recite relevant verses, or talk about libretto-writing, or anything
                <lb/>else. The meetings usually last for about 2&#189; hours.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>I shall be printing Programmes for the term in late
                <lb/>September - so if you decide to come, would you let me know your choice
                <lb/>of music before then?
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>As regards date, I would suggest Mondays Octob<unclear>e</unclear>r 29<hi rend="superscript"><unclear>th.</unclear></hi>,
                <lb/>November 5<hi rend="superscript"><unclear>th.</unclear></hi> and 12<hi rend="superscript"><unclear>th.</unclear></hi>. It has to be Monday, but, really, any Monday
                <lb/><unclear>co</unclear>nvenient to you would be convenient to us.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Yours sincerely,
                </salute>
                <signed>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_551">Pa<hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_black_driver">ul William Driver<space quantity="2" unit="char"/></hi></rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
             </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00504/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0165">
                <lb/>20
              </ab>
            </div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </body>
